        # Note pdf special handled by caller before calling parse for pure pdf? parse_format for writer 'pdf' alone - our writer selection deals earlier in conversion; if extensions present and -t pdf+xxx, caller has special messages. Here pdf is in OUTPUT_FORMATS, extensions supported set empty would trigger 23 - but pandoc treats it differently (unknown output). Caller should special-case before validation.
